{"id": "section-body-17596", "title": "Dental Abscess (Odontogenic Abscess)", "chapterId": "chapter-sixteen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-17596", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Dental Abscess (Odontogenic Abscess)", "runs": [{"text": "Dental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Abscess"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Odontogenic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Abscess)"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1126"}}, {"id": "body-17597", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Is a localized collection of pus in the orofacial region secondary to dental caries, deep fillings or failed root canal treatment and trauma to the jaws and supporting structures as a result of spread of polymicrobial infection.", "runs": [{"text": "Is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "localized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "collection"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pus"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "orofacial"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "region"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "secondary"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dental"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "caries,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "deep"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fillings"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "failed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "root"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "canal"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "treatment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and trauma to the jaws and supporting structures as a result of spread of polymicrobial infection."}]}, {"id": "body-17600", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-17601", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Fever and chills", "runs": [{"text": "Fever"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "chills"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1119"}}, {"id":